{"id":"beyleqan","qid":"Q642164","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Beyləqan","ru":"Бейлаган","en":"Beylagan"},"coordinates":[47.61556,39.76917],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"mil-mugan","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q330807","az":"Beyləqan rayonu","en":"Beylagan District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[{"form":"Jdanov","lang":"az","from":1939,"to":1989,"sources":["wd"]},{"form":"Ждановск","lang":"ru","from":1939,"to":1989,"sources":["wd","wp-ru"]},{"form":"Бейлаган","lang":"ru","from":1989,"current":true,"sources":["wd"]}],"namedAfter":[{"qid":"Q207879","az":"Andrey Jdanov","en":"Andrej Aleksandroviç Zhdanov","source":"wd"}],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Beyləqan — Azərbaycan Respublikasında şəhər, QARABAĞ iqtisadi rayonunun Beyləqan rayonunun mərkəzi, rayonun Beyləqan şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsinin mərkəzi. Şəhər Beyləqan bələdiyyəsinə aiddir.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Бейлаган (азерб. Beyləqan) — город и административный центр Бейлаганского района Миль-Муганского экономического района Азербайджана, является центром Бейлаганского городского административно-территориального округа Бейлаганского района. Город относится к Бейлаганскому муниципалитету. Расположен на Мильской равнине, в 20 км к северу от железнодорожной станции Дашбурун.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Beylagan (Azerbaijani: Beyləqan ) is the administrative centre of the Beylagan District of Azerbaijan. During the Soviet era, it was renamed Zhdanovsk (Russian: Ждановск) after close Stalin associate Andrei Zhdanov. After the collapse of the Soviet Union, the city reverted in 1991 to its original name. Beylagan is one of the oldest towns in Azerbaijan. It is located in the triangle between the Kura and Aras rivers in the Mil plain.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/Beylagan_2598.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","small":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/Beylagan_2598.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":800,"height":533,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Beylagan_2598.jpg","title":"Beylagan 2598.jpg","artist":"Gulustan","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q642164: Beylagan","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q642164","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Beyləqan","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Beyl%C9%99qan&oldid=9145333","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beyl%C9%99qan","revid":9145333,"revDate":"2026-10-16","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Бейлаган","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%B0%D0%BD&oldid=155954259","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%B0%D0%BD","revid":155954259,"revDate":"2026-11-01","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Beylagan (city)","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Beylagan_(city)&oldid=1377761828","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beylagan_(city)","revid":1377761828,"revDate":"2026-10-01","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Beylagan 2598.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Beylagan_2598.jpg","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"sourced"}